  return Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(obj, prop);
};
```

This change is localized, does not alter the public API, and matches how `hasOwnProperty` helpers are typically implemented in generated webpack runtimes. No new imports or external dependencies are needed, as it relies only on built-in JavaScript functionality.


